    "doi": null,
    "abstract": null,
    "field": "Effects of climate change on marine species",
    "problem": "This report addresses the challenge of assessing climate change impacts on marine species in the OSPAR area by synthesizing scattered evidence, a task complicated by high natural variability and the difficulty of separating climate signals from other pressures like fishing.",
    "method": "The paper proposes a meta-analysis, based on the IPCC method, that combines evidence from multiple studies to test whether observed changes in the distribution and abundance of marine biota are consistent with a priori expectations of climate change effects.",
    "task": "The task is to assess changes in the distribution and abundance of marine species in the OSPAR Maritime Area in relation to climate-driven changes in hydrodynamics and sea temperature.",
